<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: light loitering munition (incoming) -->
  <DMSE_Incoming_Sabre.label>輕型巡飛彈（來襲）</DMSE_Incoming_Sabre.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Sabre light loitering munition -->
  <DMSE_Missile_Sabre.label>軍刀輕型巡飛彈</DMSE_Missile_Sabre.label>
  <!-- EN: A tube-launched loitering munition with folding wings and an image-recognition seeker. It fits a man-portable SAM launcher, which fires it at ground targets well beyond the reach of a surface-to-air missile. It can also be fired from a launch rail for a short-range strike: its seeker hunts the most dangerous enemy creature in the open, and its loiter flight control keeps it circling until one shows up.\n\nCannot intercept incoming threats. Comes in a fixed configuration and cannot be modified. -->
  <DMSE_Missile_Sabre.description>一種管射式折翼巡飛彈，配有圖像識別導引頭。可裝入防空導彈發射具，對遠超出防空導彈射程的地面目標發射；也能從發射軌發射，進行短程打擊：導引頭會搜尋屋頂外最危險的敵方生物，盤旋飛控讓它在上空盤旋直到目標出現。\n\n無法攔截來襲威脅。固定構型，無法改造。</DMSE_Missile_Sabre.description>
  
  <!-- EN: light loitering munition -->
  <DMSE_Projectile_Sabre.label>輕型巡飛彈</DMSE_Projectile_Sabre.label>
  
</LanguageData>